{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wangwei-e-3e72d5faf3c56f5c458b","title":"《傅子》论刘表杀刘望之及容直之度","accounts":[{"id":"wangwei-a-3e72d5faf3c56f5c458b","label":"裴注引《傅子》","text":"《傅子》论刘表杀刘望之及容直之度","evidence":["wangwei-q-0464eadee4ad1fd944f1"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wangwei-q-0464eadee4ad1fd944f1"]},"ordering_evidence":"wangwei-q-0464eadee4ad1fd944f1","order":4315}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wangwei-q-0464eadee4ad1fd944f1","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-e42760c982b2861b3ec4","layer":"pei","quote":"《傅子》曰：“表既杀望之，荆州士人皆自危也。夫表之本心，于望之不轻也；以直忤情，而谗言得入者，以无容直之度也。据全楚之地，不能以成功者，未必不由此也。夷、叔忤武王以成名，丁公顺高祖以受戮，二主之度远也。若不远其度，惟褊心是从，难乎以容民蓄众矣。”","attribution":"裴注引《傅子》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0cb2b3ee65c7316d102d","start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
